00:30:20.320 --> 00:30:22.948
If I could just have one
question to ask you guys,

00:30:23.532 --> 00:30:25.367
it would definitely be

00:30:25.450 --> 00:30:28.537
if you have a favourite…

00:30:29.621 --> 00:30:32.749
if you have a favourite prop
or a favourite set piece,

00:30:32.833 --> 00:30:36.044
whether it's from the school

00:30:36.128 --> 00:30:38.338
or someone's bedroom
or the house.

00:30:39.089 --> 00:30:40.757
What is it and why?

00:30:41.466 --> 00:30:43.177
Thanks and I love you guys.

00:30:43.260 --> 00:30:44.303
Ruby's car.

00:30:45.012 --> 00:30:47.973
If that counts as a prop,
which I believe it does.

00:30:48.056 --> 00:30:49.808
That is definitely
my favourite prop.

00:30:50.475 --> 00:30:51.351
100%.

00:30:51.435 --> 00:30:53.270
The only thing I could
think of that I liked…

00:30:53.353 --> 00:30:55.147
There was just loads of,
like, penises on set

00:30:55.230 --> 00:30:57.399
that had nothing to do with
me at all

00:30:57.482 --> 00:30:59.026
that I just always liked.

00:30:59.109 --> 00:31:00.986
Which is
the most iconic scene

00:31:01.069 --> 00:31:03.488
from Sex Education
for you and why?

00:31:03.572 --> 00:31:07.492
It's so random,
but I love Mr. Hendricks,

00:31:07.576 --> 00:31:09.828
so I think my favourite part
of the scene

00:31:09.912 --> 00:31:11.496
in the series is just, like,

00:31:12.080 --> 00:31:13.498
when he's practising
with the band

00:31:13.582 --> 00:31:14.541
and he's going over
the moves

00:31:14.625 --> 00:31:16.543
and he's like: "Up, up,
twist, over" and all that.

00:31:16.627 --> 00:31:17.586
I loved that bit.

00:31:17.669 --> 00:31:19.880
And, like, his little beef
with Quentin.

00:31:19.963 --> 00:31:21.507
That, yeah, that, for me,

00:31:21.590 --> 00:31:22.633
is the most iconic bit
of the show.

00:31:22.716 --> 00:31:25.219
That's the bit… I've got
that saved on YouTube.

00:31:25.302 --> 00:31:26.970
I go back
and watch it occasionally.

00:31:32.100 --> 00:31:34.269
Laurie, Jordan,
Kenny and Agnes,

00:31:34.353 --> 00:31:36.647
thank you all for joining me
for this episode of

00:31:36.730 --> 00:31:38.440
Sex Education Unpacked.

00:31:38.524 --> 00:31:40.943
Sadly,
it's time to say goodbye.

00:31:41.026 --> 00:31:41.902
I'll see you soon

00:31:41.985 --> 00:31:44.488
and don't forget to watch
Sex Education season three.

